  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The strength of <math><mn>11.2</mn></math> volume solution of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is</p><p>[Given that, the molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>13.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
